OL,5,G2100 The Catch
OL,6,     FPsychological thriller with Jason
OL,7,     FWatkins. When struggling fisherman
OL,8,     FEd's daughter Abbie brings home
OL,9,     Fher new boyfriend Ryan, Ed is
OL,10,     Fsuspicious of the rich and
OL,11,     Fsuccessful newcomer... (Ep1/4)
OL,12,G2200 The Catch
OL,13,     FEd discovers that someone is
OL,14,     Fspying on him and knows a dark
OL,15,     Fsecret from his past. Meanwhile,
OL,16,     FBob informs Ed that he saw George
OL,17,     Fon CCTV, heading to the boat. Is
OL,18,     Fhe behind the sabotage? (Ep2/4)
